    <CHAPTER cnumber="17">
      <VERS vnumber="1"> My <gr str="7307">breath </gr>is <gr str="2254">corrupt</gr>, my <gr str="3117">days </gr>are <gr str="2193">extinct</gr>, the <gr str="6913">graves </gr>
